  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strategic Impact Evaluation and Learning (SIEL) ODA</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Evaluations constitute a significant part of FCDO&#x2019;s investments to generate evidence and maximise impact. When appropriate, Randomised Controlled Trials (RCTs) and quasi-experimental methodologies are the most rigorous tools to measure impact of interventions and attribute it to FCDO. This programme supports FCDO to use these and other rigorous methodologies to robustly evaluate the impact of programmes, provide strong evidence to inform spending decisions around strategic priorities for the organisation and ultimately maximise Value for Money (VfM) of each &#xa3; spend by the UK Government.</narrative>
  </description>
